════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  FRONTEND INTEGRATION REFERENCE
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

   ┌─ COMPARE (read-only) ──────────────────────────────────────────┐
   │ GET /compare/{tokenIn}/{tokenOut}/{amount}                     │
   │ ← { samm: { effectiveRate, shard },                           │
   │      sepoliaUniswap: { effectiveRate, routing },               │
   │      comparison: { winner, deltaPercent } }                    │
   └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

   ┌─ SWAP FLOW (user signs in MetaMask) ──────────────────────────┐
   │                                                                │
   │ 1. POST /swap/sepolia/prepare                                  │
   │    Body: { userAddress, tokenIn, tokenOut, amount, type }      │
   │    ← { quote, permitData, needsPermit2Signature, flow }       │
   │                                                                │
   │ 2. If ERC-20 → user approves Permit2 contract (one-time)      │
   │    token.approve(0x000000000022D473...dDEE9F6B43aC78BA3, MAX)  │
   │                                                                │
   │ 3. If needsPermit2Signature → user signs typed data           │
   │    wallet.signTypedData(domain, types, values)                 │
   │                                                                │
   │ 4. POST /swap/sepolia/execute                                  │
   │    Body: { quote, signature, permitData, routing }             │
   │    ← { unsignedTransaction: { to, data, value, gasLimit } }   │
   │                                                                │
   │ 5. User sends tx in MetaMask                                   │
   │    wallet.sendTransaction(unsignedTransaction)                  │
   │                                                                │
   └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

   ┌─ BRIDGE (L1 ↔ L2) ────────────────────────────────────────────┐
   │ POST /bridge/deposit   { amount: "0.01" }  Sepolia → RiseChain│
   │ POST /bridge/withdraw  { amount: "0.01" }  RiseChain → Sepolia│
   │ GET  /bridge/balances                      Both chains        │
   │ GET  /bridge/status                        Contract addresses │
   └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

   ┌─ ENS DISCOVERY ────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
   │ GET /agents              All agent identities (on-chain)       │
   │ GET /agents/:name        Single agent + text records           │
   │ GET /registry/shards     All shard ENS subnames                │
   └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
